{"bookId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54", "title": "王小波全集", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1679116005, "updated": [{"bookId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54", "bookmarkId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54_21_3228-3259", "createTime": 1679116005, "range": "3228-3259", "markText": "至于可以使人成王的哲学，我认为它可以使王者更聪明，老百姓更笨。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21}, {"bookId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54", "bookmarkId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54_21_2052-2217", "createTime": 1679115729, "range": "2052-2217", "markText": "比方说，朱熹老夫子格物、致知，最后是为了齐家、治国、平天下。因为本人不姓朱，还可以免于被齐，被治和被平总是免不了的。假如这个逻辑可以成立，生活就是很不安全的。很可能在我不知道的地方，有一位我全然不认识的先生在努力地格、致，只要他功夫到家，不管我乐意不乐意，也不管他打算怎样下手，我都要被治和平，而且根本不知自己会被修理成什么模样。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "理想国与哲人王", "chapterUid": 21, "chapterIdx": 21}], "book": {"bookId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54", "version": 52793224, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_ARyAusAr7B2O6ds6cKFQBCnu_parsecover", "title": "王小波全集", "author": "王小波", "coverBoxInfo": {"colorsPure": ["#93B0DA", "#98B8DD"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7GNMmStfh", "review": {"bookId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54", "content": "王小波对儒家的批判，骨子里是人文精神。", "bookVersion": 52793224, "range": "3228-3259", "abstract": "至于可以使人成王的哲学，我认为它可以使王者更聪明，老百姓更笨。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 21, "reviewId": "17408780_7GNMmStfh", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1679116076, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_DEoH2AH0OG2z6en6cMCyAD54", "format": "epub", "version": 52793224, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_ARyAusAr7B2O6ds6cKFQBCnu_parsecover", "title": "王小波全集", "author": "王小波", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 21, "chapterTitle": "理想国与哲人王", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpF